-- A decision BRANCH that mixes a `period reaches` arm with an ordinary
-- condition. Dated formulas need every arm to be a `period reaches` guard;
-- a mixed BRANCH has no OpenFisca form. The export must REFUSE it.
IMPORT prelude

DECLARE Person HAS salary IS A NUMBER
DECLARE Period HAS year IS A NUMBER, month IS A NUMBER

GIVEN `the period` IS A Period, y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`period reaches` MEANS
    (`the period`'s year GREATER THAN y)
    OR (`the period`'s year EQUALS y AND `the period`'s month AT LEAST m)

@export Allowance
GIVEN p      IS A Person
      period IS A Period
GIVETH A NUMBER
`allowance` p period MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `period reaches` OF period, 2020, 1 THEN 300
        IF p's salary GREATER THAN 1000 THEN 0
        OTHERWISE 100

#ASSERT (`allowance` OF (Person WITH salary IS 2000), (Period WITH year IS 2019, month IS 6)) EQUALS 0
